webChannel": null, "dvdCountry": null, "externals": {"tvrage": null, "thetvdb": null, "imdb": null}, "image": {"medium": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/624/1561938.jpg", "original": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/624/1561938.jpg"}, "summary": "<p><b>Dastane Yek Shahr</b> is an Iranian television drama series created by Asghar Farhadi that follows a diverse team of young journalists and producers working on a social documentary program called <i>\"In the City\"</i> for Tehran's Network 5. As they investigate and report on various contemporary social issues facing urban Iran, the personal lives, relationships, and moral dilemmas of the crew members become inextricably linked to the stories they cover, creating a meta-narrative that blends documentary realism with character-driven fiction.</p>", "updated": 1778546630, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91846"}, "previousepisode": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3615687", "name": "Episode 35"}}}, {"id": 91864, "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/91864/roozegar-e-javani", "name": "Roozegar-e Javani", "type": "Scripted", "language": "Persian", "genres": ["Drama"], "status": "Ended", "runtime": 50, "averageRuntime": 50, "premiered": null, "ended": null, "officialSite": null, "schedule": {"time": "", "days": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]}, "rating": {"average": null}, "weight": 20, "network": {"id": 2076, "name": "IRIB TV5", "country": {"name": "Iran, Islamic Republic of", "code": "IR", "timezone": "Asia/Tehran"}, "officialSite": "http://www.tv5.ir/"}, "webChannel": null, "dvdCountry": null, "externals": {"tvrage": null, "thetvdb": null, "imdb": null}, "image": {"medium": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/624/1562177.jpg", "original": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/624/1562177.jpg"}, "summary": "<p>Five young students from other Iranian cities studying in Tehran rent a house and live together. Each of these five people has a different personality and they encounter a new story in each episode. But in the end, they help each other overcome the problems.</p><p>Reliable airdates for the episodes/seasons are virtually impossible to find.<br />Season 1 aired somewhere between March 1998 - March 1999 (1377, Solar Hijri).<br />Season 2 aired somewhere between March 1999 - March 2000 (1378, Solar Hijri).<br />Season 3 aired in 2021 (1399, Solar Hijri).</p>", "updated": 1778607283, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91864"}}}, {"id": 91865, "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/91865/yadashthaye-koodaki", "name": "Yadashthaye koodaki", "type": "Scripted", "language": "Persian", "genres": ["Drama"], "status": "Ended", "runtime": null, "averageRuntime": null, "premiered": "2001-11-17", "ended": "2001-12-21", "officialSite": null, "schedule": {"time": "", "days": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]}, "rating": {"average": null}, "weight": 34, "network": {"id": 2076, "name": "IRIB TV5", "country": {"name": "Iran, Islamic Republic of", "code": "IR", "timezone": "Asia/Tehran"}, "officialSite": "http://www.tv5.ir/"}, "webChannel": null, "dvdCountry": null, "externals": {"tvrage": null, "thetvdb": null, "imdb": null}, "image": {"medium": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/624/1562186.jpg", "original": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/624/1562186.jpg"}, "summary": "<p>Khan Baba and Raba Khanum have been caretakers of Agha Bozor's house since they were young, and now that they have reached old age, the residents of the house no longer visit them. One day before Ramadan, Hamid, one of the grandsons of Agha Bozor, comes home and asks Khan Baba to imprison him in one of the rooms of the house.</p>", "updated": 1778608580, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91865"}, "previousepiso